{"At precisely \0035 o’clock\004, like every morning, hours before a single stirring would emerge from the rooms upstairs, Dora dragged herself from her bed and made her way down the hallway to the kitchen, where she put on a kettle and dropped a bag of Earl Grey in a mug.","When the Summer Was Ours","Roxanne Veletzos",true},
