{"THE HAMMER BANGED reveille on the rail outside camp HQ at \003five o’clock\004 as always. Time to get up. The ragged noise was muffled by ice two fingers thick on the windows and soon died away. Too cold for the warder to go on hammering.","One Day in the Life of Ivan Denosovich","Aleksandr Solzhenitsyn",true},
